<title>BRAZIL: Opening prices for June 11 Brazil coffee auction.</title>
<headline>Opening prices for June 11 Brazil coffee auction.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Opening prices for the 42,250 60-kg bags of coffee stocks to be auctioned by the Brazilian government at 1400 local/1700 GMT on June 11 are as follows, according to Banco do Brasil which is holding the sale.</p>
<p>Quantity is given in bags, price in Brazilian reais per bag.</p>
<p>    QTY     CROP	COLOR	LOCATION		    PRICE</p>
<p>    7,095  1987/88  Greenish    Varginha, MG		   166</p>
<p>    8,015  1986/87  Greenish    Sao Sebastiao Paraiso, MG  166</p>
<p>    3,190  1988/89  Greenish    Rolandia, PR		   162</p>
<p>    2,690  1988/89  Greenish    Rolandia, PR		   162</p>
<p>    5,850  1988/89  Light green Rolandia, PR		   162</p>
<p>    2,230  1988/89  Light green Rolandia, PR		   166</p>
<p>	855  1988/89  Yellowish   Rolandia, PR		   166</p>
<p>    1,974  1986/87  Yellowish   Alphaville-Barueri, SP     168</p>
<p>	150  1986/87  Yellowish   Alphaville-Barueri, SP     169</p>
<p>    1,253  1986/87  Yellowish   Alphaville-Barueri, SP     169</p>
<p>    2,205  1986/87  Yellowish   Alphaville-Barueri, SP     169</p>
<p>    2,173  1986/87  Yellowish   Alphaville-Barueri, SP     168</p>
<p>    2,300  1986/87  Yellowish   Alphaville-Barueri, SP     169</p>
<p>    2,270  1986/87  Yellowish   Alphaville-Barueri, SP     165</p>
<p>TOTAL - 42,250 bags</p>
<p>((-Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151))</p>
